      "snippet": "BERTimbau - Portuguese BERT This repository contains pre-trained BERT models trained on the Portuguese language. BERT-Base and BERT-Large Cased variants were trained on the BrWaC (Brazilian Web as Corpus), a large Portuguese corpus, for 1,000,000 steps, using whole-word mask. Model artifacts for TensorFlow and PyTorch can be found below."
